&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moniepoint Inc. is Africa’s all-in-one financial platform, helping 20 million businesses and individuals access seamless payments, banking, credit, cross-border, and business management tools each month.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Nigeria’s largest merchant acquirer, we power most of the country’s point-of-sale (POS) transactions. Through our subsidiaries, Moniepoint Inc. processes over $250 billion in digital payment transaction value annually.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Curious about what makes Moniepoint an incredible place to work? &lt;a href=&quot;https://moniepoint.com/blog&quot;&gt;Check out posts on how we cultivate a culture of innovation, teamwork, and growth.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get to do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate fraud attacks, quantify their impact, and present clear findings that drive prioritisation and response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose and refine rule-based mitigations, working with fraud operations and engineering to see them through to implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain reporting and dashboards to monitor fraud trends, rule performance, and key operational metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with fraud operations, data scientists, engineers, and product managers to ensure analytical insights translate into action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify emerging patterns and flag risks before they escalate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To succeed in this role, you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as a Data Analyst (Fraud),&amp;nbsp; or a similar role (4+ years, can be made up for with accomplishments)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency with SQL. you&#39;re comfortable writing complex queries to investigate and slice data across large datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fraud, risk, or financial services; you understand how fraud attacks work and how to think about mitigation trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive mindset — you don&#39;t wait to be asked; you spot something unusual and you dig in&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some exposure to Python or scripting for data manipulation and analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with a BI tool (PowerBI, Looker, Tableau, Superset, Redash, or any other alternative)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills; you can communicate findings clearly to fraud operations, product managers, engineers, and senior leadership — and you know how to influence decisions with data across all of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working in fast-paced, cross-functional teams where priorities shift quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with a spreadsheet tool (Microsoft Excel or Google Sheets, or any other alternative)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy autonomy and a flat structure: we have millions of customers and a flat hierarchy so any individual can have an outsized impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A drive to learn and master new technologies and techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Statistics, Mathematics, Engineering, or any other related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience with the following would be a plus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python or any other scripting language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Git or any other version control tool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture - We put our people first and prioritise the well-being of every team member. We have built a company where all opinions carry weight and where all voices are heard. We value and respect each other and always look out for one another. Above all, we are human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning - We have a learning and development-focused environment with an emphasis on knowledge sharing, training, and regular internal technical talks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation - You’ll receive an attractive salary, pension, health insurance, annual bonus, plus other benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect in the hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A preliminary phone call with the recruiter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical take-home task (SQL test).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Interview with hiring manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A behavioural interview with the Head of Data Analytics/Science and Fraud Team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Moniepoint is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees and candidates.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-119&quot;&gt;Ranked in 2024 by the Financial Times, Moniepoint is Africa’s fastest-growing fintech, trusted by over 10 million business and individual accounts, processing billions of Naira in transactions monthly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;12,5&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-118&quot;&gt;Our mission is to enable financial happiness for every African, everywhere&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;12,7&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;About this role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0cd24779a7324afc-115&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Data Scientist to sit at the heart of how we fight fraud — building the models, experiments, and detection systems that protect millions of customers and merchants across our platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2&quot;&gt;. This is a high-impact role at the intersection of machine learning, product, and engineering, where your work will directly shape how Moniepoint detects and responds to emerging fraud threats&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0cd24779a7324afc-116&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0&quot;&gt;You are a data-driven, intellectually curious Data Scientist who is energized by hard problems in fraud and financial crime&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2&quot;&gt;. You&#39;ll prototype and ship ML models, design experiments, and uncover new fraud signals across our ecosystem — partnering closely with engineers, product managers, and analysts to turn your work into production-grade systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0cd24779a7324afc-117&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Prototype, evaluate, and help produce machine learning models for fraud detection; own their ongoing monitoring and retraining cycles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0cd24779a7324afc-118&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Design and run experiments to measure the impact of fraud interventions, balancing customer experience against loss reduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0cd24779a7324afc-119&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Size fraud typologies across our product lines to inform prioritization and investment decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0cd24779a7324afc-120&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0,0&quot;&gt;Build and maintain anomaly detection systems to surface novel fraud vectors before they scale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0cd24779a7324afc-121&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0,0&quot;&gt;Work closely with fraud operations, engineers, product managers, and data analysts to translate model outputs into real-world mitigations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Background:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strong foundation in statistics with a degree in a quantitative field (Statistics, Mathematics, Engineering, Computer Science, or similar).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3+ years of experience in data science, decision science, or risk analytics within fraud, payments, or financial crime.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience building and deploying machine learning models in a production environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fraud, risk, or financial services experience is a strong plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solid grounding in data science fundamentals: experimentation, statistical inference, model evaluation, and feature engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfort working in fast-paced, cross-functional teams with high ownership expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Competencies:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0cd24779a7324afc-126&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;14,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;14,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Python and SQL; comfort working across the full model development lifecycle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;14,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0cd24779a7324afc-127&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;14,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;14,1,0,0&quot;&gt;An investigative instinct — you enjoy digging into data to find patterns others miss&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;14,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0cd24779a7324afc-128&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;14,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;14,2,0,0&quot;&gt;The ability to communicate technical findings clearly to non-technical stakeholders and translate insights into action&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;14,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What Success Looks Like in This Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0cd24779a7324afc-129&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Production-grade ML models and anomaly detection systems that effectively surface and mitigate novel fraud vectors before they scale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0cd24779a7324afc-130&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;16,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Well-designed experiments that successfully balance customer experience against fraud loss reduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0cd24779a7324afc-131&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Clear sizing of fraud typologies that effectively drives product prioritization and strategic investment decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2,0,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-39 citation-end-39&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0cd24779a7324afc-132&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;16,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-38 citation-end-38&quot;&gt;Seamless cross-functional alignment where technical model outputs are consistently translated into real-world fraud mitigations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,3,0,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-37 citation-end-37&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_0cd24779a7324afc-138&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-36 citation-end-36&quot;&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;18,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-35&quot;&gt;Culture:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-35 citation-end-35&quot;&gt; We put our people first and prioritize the well-being of every team member&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;18,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-34 citation-end-34&quot;&gt;. We&#39;ve built a company where all opinions carry weight and where all voi&lt;/span&gt;ces are heard&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;18,4&quot;&gt;. We value and respect each other and always look out for one another&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;18,6&quot;&gt;. Above all, we are human&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;18,8&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;19,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; We have a learning and development-focused environment with an emphasis on knowledge sharing, training, and regular internal technical talks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;19,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;20,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll receive an attractive salary, pension, health insurance, annual bonus, plus other benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;20,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Moniepoint is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees and candidates.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moniepoint Inc. is Africa’s all-in-one financial platform, helping 20 million businesses and individuals access seamless payments, banking, credit, cross-border, and business management tools each month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Nigeria’s largest merchant acquirer, we power most of the country’s point-of-sale (POS) transactions. Through our subsidiaries, Moniepoint Inc. processes over $250 billion in digital payment transaction value annually.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why the UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The UK is home to our headquarters where more than 70 team members are based, with team members joining us from companies like Tide, Klarna, Revolut, Capital One, Teya, Wise, Starling, Monzo, and many others! Our London office is located at Sea Containers, just by London Bridge - this is also where a significant number of our most senior leaders sit, which makes it a natural base for a Head of Engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So, now we are looking for our Head of Engineering, Field Verification to join us in UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Field Verification is how Moniepoint knows that the people and businesses on our platform are real. Every Moniepoint customer, retail and business, requires a completed field verification as part of KYC. The platform coordinates physical, in-person checks — verifying individuals, business owners, business addresses and loan guarantors — and it serves nearly every part of the company: onboarding, loans, compliance and the fraud team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The system works today. A back office gives each business unit visibility and control over its own verification requests. A mobile-friendly web app puts the work in the hands of Field Verification Officers and the cluster leads who manage them across local government areas. An API layer lets other business units push verification requests in and receive results back by webhook, and an assignment algorithm routes each request to an officer close enough to carry it out.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to be straightforward about the rest. This domain has never had a dedicated engineering leader, and that is the single biggest constraint on it. The team is one lean, cross-functional squad — an Engineering Manager, four engineers and a QA — carrying verification volume for the entire customer base. They have done that impressively well, but running lean means running in keep-the-lights-on mode, and a long list of things that would make this platform substantially better has been waiting for someone to own it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That list is the role. Trip and route management, so an officer can plan an optimal day across several sites rather than making a separate journey for each one — today we pay for a round trip per verification, and the logistics are nowhere near optimal. Capacity management. A native mobile app, wanted for a long time and never resourced. Liveness and identity verification tooling, exposed as APIs the rest of the business can build on. And as Moniepoint expands into markets where identity verification is as difficult as it is in Nigeria, Kenya among them, a platform that works beyond a single country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is a great deal of room to build here. Whoever takes this on will set the direction rather than inherit someone else&#39;s plan, on a system that already carries real weight for the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As Head of Engineering, Field Verification, your responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning the technical strategy, architecture and roadmap for the Field Verification platform end to end, and setting direction for a domain that has been running without dedicated engineering leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Moving the platform from keep-the-lights-on operation to deliberate, prioritised development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading and growing the existing cross-functional team, and building the organisation out as scope expands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building the operational efficiency layer — trip and route optimisation, task allocation and capacity management for field officers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning the platform&#39;s client-facing surface: the APIs and webhooks that other business units integrate with, and the back office those units rely on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering a native mobile experience for field officers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring verification data is structured, auditable and fit for compliance scrutiny.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building for multi-country expansion as Moniepoint enters new markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering closely with Product and with the business units that depend on the platform — onboarding, loans, compliance and fraud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defining architecture standards, engineering processes and quality metrics, and hiring and developing engineers and Engineering Managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have built things yourself, and grew into leadership from there. We are explicit about this: we are not looking for someone who moved into management early and has led from a distance since. We want an engineer who became a leader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are capable across disciplines. Backend, web and mobile. This platform spans all three and you will need credibility in each — a specialist in one layer will struggle here.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have built platforms, not just products. Systems used by several distinct groups of users and internal business units, with the flexibility to serve requirements you did not anticipate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a problem solver first. We would rather have someone adaptable than someone with the exact domain experience. Having built across different industries — fintech, e-commerce, logistics or otherwise — is a positive signal, not a scattered CV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 10+ years of overall software engineering experience, with substantial hands-on production engineering and strong backend depth. Our backend environment is Java and Spring Boot.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least 5 years of engineering leadership, including managing Engineering Managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You collaborate well with product and business stakeholders, and can translate operational requirements into engineering solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with location and geospatial data is a strong plus, including map integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with route, trip or delivery optimisation is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building for compliance — where data must be structured to evidence what was done and when — is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with identity, KYC or verification platforms is a plus. None of these four are requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moniepoint Inc. is Africa’s all-in-one financial platform, helping 20 million businesses and individuals access seamless payments, banking, credit, cross-border, and business management tools each month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Nigeria’s largest merchant acquirer, we power most of the country’s point-of-sale (POS) transactions. Through our subsidiaries, Moniepoint Inc. processes over $250 billion in digital payment transaction value annually.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Poland&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Poland is a new and deliberate addition to our engineering map. We recently made our first technology hire in the country, and we are looking at Poland as a long-term strategic location for senior hires, particularly within our engineering organisation. Joining now means joining early, and helping shape what our presence here becomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So, now we are looking for our Head of Engineering, Sales &amp;amp; Marketing Tools, to join us in Poland.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sales and Marketing Tools owns MonieCRM, the operating system for Moniepoint&#39;s 50,000-strong sales network. This is not a CRM we bought — it is a workforce operations platform built entirely in-house for a multi-level field sales hierarchy, and it is how those teams run their day to day: the portfolio of businesses they manage, their own teams, their goals and performance, the physical and digital resources they need in the field, and an emerging AI-assisted support layer. Sixteen capabilities span onboarding and network management, pipeline and portfolio, performance and goals, compensation, and sales experience and support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A significant part of the domain moves money. The platform owns wallets, commission calculation and attribution, cashout and welfare funds for a network that drives the overwhelming majority of company revenue — which makes financial correctness, not just availability, a core engineering requirement of the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alongside that, the domain covers partner management, a rewards and retention platform serving tens of millions of users, and our marketing technology stack, including the engineering and customisation of Braze, the platform we use for customer engagement. The mandate is modernisation and reliability: re-architecting systems that have grown very quickly and making them dependable at a scale of more than 20 million users. This is a platform engineering and legacy modernisation challenge first and foremost, and prior CRM or SalesTech experience is genuinely not required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 10–15 years of overall software engineering experience, with at least 5 years leading engineering teams through growth phases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of hands-on, production-level experience writing and shipping Java code as a practising engineer. This means years spent writing Java yourself, not years spent overseeing teams who write it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years of experience managing managers — leading an engineering organisation through other engineering leaders, rather than running a single team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have proven platform engineering experience at scale — building and running complex distributed systems, not feature delivery alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have navigated legacy migrations and re-architecture projects at 20M+ user scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong backend engineering skills in high-throughput, data-intensive distributed systems, and are proficient in Java and Spring Boot.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have managed and developed large engineering teams of 20 or more members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building systems where financial correctness matters — commissions, payouts, wallets, ledgers or equivalent — is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fintech or payments background is strongly preferred. CRM or SalesTech domain experience is nice to have and explicitly not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to customer engagement or marketing automation platforms such as Braze is a plus, but not a requirement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultural Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As well, we assess every candidate across eight dimensions that define how great leaders operate at Moniepoint. We look for evidence of all eight throughout the process, not just in a single conversation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Obsession: Build deep empathy for users. Solve problems intuitively, and fix root causes, not just tickets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft: Master the fundamentals. Reason from first principles, make trade-offs explicit, and raise the bar on quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systemisation: Turn repeating decisions into scalable mechanisms. Reduce cognitive load and raise engineering quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Urgency: Move with disciplined speed. Act autonomously within scope, remove friction, and escalate risks early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership: Treat the platform as your own. Take initiative across boundaries and follow through without reminders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No Ego: Put the mission first. Share credit, welcome debate, and never protect status over team outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candour: Surface uncomfortable truths and risks early. Intelligent failure is welcome; concealment is not.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrity: Stay truthful and ethically consistent. Refuse toxic behavior. Performance without integrity is unacceptable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
